    - button "Rename Creature": Rename
    - button "Remove Creature" [disabled]: Remove
    - text: Artifact
    - paragraph: 10 cards
    - switch "Hide Artifact": Hide
    - switch "Artifact in deck" [checked]: In Deck
    - button "Rename Artifact": Rename
    - button "Remove Artifact" [disabled]: Remove
    - text: Enchantment
    - paragraph: 5 cards
    - switch "Hide Enchantment": Hide
    - switch "Enchantment in deck" [checked]: In Deck
    - button "Rename Enchantment": Rename
    - button "Remove Enchantment" [disabled]: Remove
    - text: Instant
    - paragraph: 10 cards
    - switch "Hide Instant": Hide
    - switch "Instant in deck" [checked]: In Deck
    - button "Rename Instant": Rename
    - button "Remove Instant" [disabled]: Remove
    - text: Sideboard
